       SLIDE 2 — Field Insights
       ================================================================ -->
  <div class="dt-slide">
    <div class="slide-header">
      <span class="title">Mexico — Field Insights: Key Learnings</span>
      <span class="period">Alegra Talks · Jun 2026</span>
    </div>
    <div class="dt-body">
      <div class="dt-subtitle">In-person sessions with accountants in Mexico City · Alegra Talks · Jun 2026</div>
      <div class="insights-list">
        <div class="insight-row">
          <div class="insight-num">1</div>
          <div class="insight-content">
            <div class="insight-title">Migration is the biggest barrier — and it's about trust, not capability</div>
            <div class="insight-desc">Accountants accept Alegra's product advantage but are reluctant to move decades of client portfolios off legacy software.</div>
            <div class="insight-hl">The ask: Alegra's own team runs the migration — led by accountants, not sales reps, who carry the credibility the process requires.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-row">
          <div class="insight-num">2</div>
          <div class="insight-content">
            <div class="insight-title">Peer validation is the primary engine of adoption</div>
            <div class="insight-desc">Accountants trust a fellow accountant far more than a sales contact, and in-person, peer-to-peer settings build confidence a sales call cannot.</div>
            <div class="insight-hl">Growth in the segment is driven by word of mouth and by demos grounded in real client cases.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-row">
          <div class="insight-num">3</div>
          <div class="insight-content">
            <div class="insight-title">A persistent trust gap around Alegra's local identity</div>
            <div class="insight-desc">Prospects question whether Alegra is genuinely Mexican, established at scale, and whether Mexico is a true strategic priority.</div>
            <div class="insight-hl">A matter of perception, not product — closing it is a positioning and communications challenge.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-row">
          <div class="insight-num">4</div>
          <div class="insight-content">
            <div class="insight-title">The accountant's role is in transition — and AI is the draw</div>
            <div class="insight-desc">Reduced to "tax-return filers" — and the SAT will eventually pre-populate filings. Many come to Alegra for its AI and the chance to return to an advisory role.</div>
            <div class="insight-hl">A major positioning opportunity — but activation breaks at onboarding, where thin guidance stalls setup before the value lands.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="slide-divider">↓ &nbsp; 3 / 3</div>

  <!-- ================================================================
       SLIDE 3 — Pricing Strategy
       ================================================================ -->
  <div class="dt-slide">
    <div class="slide-header">
      <span class="title">Mexico Pricing: Aligning Price to Value by ICP</span>
      <span class="period">{{ config.month_label }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="dt-body">
      <div class="dt-subtitle">Each customer pays for the variable that reflects their value — <strong>accountants by portfolio scale</strong>, <strong>SMBs by capabilities</strong> — with <strong>e-invoicing as a baseline</strong>.</div>
      <div class="pricing-cols">
        <div class="left-col">
          <div class="col-label">What is changing — 4 moves</div>
          <div class="moves-list">
            <div class="move-item">
              <div class="move-num">1</div>
              <div class="move-text">
                <div class="move-title">Tiered accountant plan</div>
                <div class="move-desc">Replace the flat $990 unlimited plan with a 4-tier scale priced on <span class="accent">active RFCs (clients) managed</span>.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="move-item">
              <div class="move-num">2</div>
              <div class="move-text">
                <div class="move-title">E-invoicing as baseline</div>
                <div class="move-desc">Make e-invoicing an RFC-level baseline covered by the plan — removing it as a billing lever across all three ICPs.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="move-item">
              <div class="move-num">3</div>
              <div class="move-text">
                <div class="move-title">Invited SMB lane</div>
                <div class="move-desc">Open a free entry lane for clients an accountant brings onto the platform.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="move-item">
              <div class="move-num">4</div>
              <div class="move-text">
                <div class="move-title">Unified pricing page</div>
                <div class="move-desc">Consolidate SMB / ERP / Accountant into one differentiated page — modeled on Costa Rica's live version.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bottom-boxes">
            <div class="info-box neutral">
              <div class="box-label">↔ What is not changing</div>
              <div class="box-title">Pyme/Empresa catalog stays intact.</div>
              <div class="box-desc">Facturación, Gestión (ERP) and POS keep current prices — a packaging change, <strong>not a catalog reprice</strong>.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-box accent">
              <div class="box-label">🔓 Why now — Expansion unlock</div>
              <div class="box-desc">Today an accountant pays the same for <strong>2 or 200 companies</strong>. Tiering adds the scale lever the portfolio needs to compound NRR.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="right-col">
          <div class="browser-wrap">
            <div class="browser-bar">
              <div class="b-dots">
                <div class="b-dot"></div><div class="b-dot"></div><div class="b-dot"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="b-url">alegra.com/mx/precios/contadores</div>
            </div>
            <div class="mockup-body">
